  "solution": "**The logic followed here is:**\n\nBODMAS table\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/13bc0065c96e715682af7c8a6dc1b4c567b7a2a89597cc68809a5ff942c7e421.png] \n\nGiven : 31 * 13 * 7 * 54 * 12 * 4 * 20\n\nOption 1.=, ÷, -, × , +, - by subsituiting according to BODMAS rule\n\n \n• 31 = **13 ÷ 7** - 54 × 12 + 4 -20\n \n• 31 = 1.85 - 54 × 12 + 4 -20\n \n• 31 = **1.85**** **- 648 + **4** - 20\n \n• 31 =** 5.85** **- 648 - 20**\n \n• 31 ≠ 662.1( LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 2. +, × , -, =, × , + by subsituiting according to BODMAS rule\n\n \n• 31 + **13 × 7 **- 54 = **12 × 4 **+ 20\n \n• **31 + 91** - 54 =** 48 + 20**\n \n• **122 - 54** = 68\n \n• **68 = 68 ( LHS = RHS )**\n\nOption 3. -, -, =, × , +, ÷ by subsituiting according to BODMAS rule\n\n \n• 31 - 13 - 7 = 54 × 12 + **4 ÷ 20**\n \n• 31 - 13 - 7 = **54 × 12** + **0.2**\n \n• 31 - 13 - 7 = **648 + 0.2**\n \n• **31 - 13 - 7** = 648.02 \n \n• **31 - 20 **= 648.02 \n \n• **11 ≠ 648.2**( LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 4. +, -, =, × , -, + by subsituiting according to BODMAS rule\n\n \n• 31 + 13 - 7 =** 54 × 12 **- 4 + 20\n \n• **31 + 13** - 7 = **648** - 4 **+ 20**\n \n• **44** -** 7 = 648 **- **16**\n \n• 37 ≠ 632( LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nHence, **+, × , -, =, × , +** is the correct answer.",
